@startuml
title SA-S01 — Standard order lifecycle
caption Order owns progress, Settlement owns verification | PRD-08–12
[*] --> Intake
Intake --> AwaitingFee : merchant delivery
Intake --> AwaitingCash : cash pickup
Intake --> PendingProof : direct DuitNow and hold
AwaitingFee --> PendingProof : customer confirms fee and hold
AwaitingCash --> Accepted : merchant secures capacity
PendingProof --> Review : timely proof
PendingProof --> Expired : deadline, no proof
Review --> Accepted : verified and feasible
Review --> Exception : disputed payment or missed handoff
Review --> Review : top-up notice, hold 30 min; timely proof holds through review
Review --> Expired : top-up cutoff with no timely proof, release unused capacity
Accepted --> Preparing
Preparing --> Ready
Ready --> Completed : handoff or cash receipt
Ready --> NoShow : pickup not made
Ready --> Exception : handoff fails
Intake --> Cancelled : cancellation guard
AwaitingFee --> Cancelled : customer before payment and acceptance
AwaitingCash --> Cancelled : customer before acceptance or merchant declines
PendingProof --> Cancelled : owner confirms no transfer, unaccepted
PendingProof --> PendingProof : sent or unsure, contact merchant on WhatsApp
Review --> Review : customer cancellation blocked, WhatsApp follow-up
Exception --> Cancelled : merchant decision
Exception --> Accepted : merchant and customer reschedule
@enduml
